  "common-default-rails/sine": "* quiz circuit\n* issue: missing_value M1\n* issue: floating_pin M1.1\n* issue: floating_pin M1.2\n* issue: kind_not_allowed L1\n* issue: value_out_of_range x\n* issue: duplicate_name L1\n* issue: kind_not_allowed M1\n* issue: duplicate_name M1\n* issue: floating_pin Q1.D\n* issue: floating_pin Q1.G\n* issue: floating_pin Rload.D\n* issue: unconnected_port in+\nRM1 n1 n2 1e+4\nRx vcc n3 1e+20\nDL1 vcc n4 DSI\nMQ1 n5 n6 vcc vcc NMOSE\nMRload n7 n3 n4 n4 PMOSE\n.model DSI D(IS=1e-14 N=1)\n.model NMOSE NMOS(LEVEL=1 VTO=1 KP=1e-3)\n.model PMOSE PMOS(LEVEL=1 VTO=-1 KP=1e-3)\nVin in 0 SIN(5e-1 1e+0 1e+3)\nRload out outl 1e+12\nVmeas outl 0 0\n.tran 1e-5 5e-3 0\n.control\nset wr_vecnames\nset wr_singlescale\nrun\nlinearize v(in) v(out) i(Vmeas)\nwrdata /dev/stdout v(in) v(out) i(Vmeas)\n.endc\n.end\n",
